        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968180/extras/1e7d3e6eaa087bf4354580153d72c424.poster.avif?t=1788343517\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968180/extras/1e7d3e6eaa087bf4354580153d72c424.webm?t=1788343517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968180/extras/1e7d3e6eaa087bf4354580153d72c424.mp4?t=1788343517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low wage. Exhaustion. Expensive fish and chips. Welcome to the United Kingdom.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DIGGERGUN is an oppressive life sim platformer about workers, minimum pay and the environment. You’re trapped on a blustery island, forced to work at Cornwall Mining Corp where it’s shadier than the game’s monochrome palette. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, you need to earn £3000 from digging precious lithium. To survive, you need to manage your time, energy and money during the rigid day-and-night cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you make ends meet while digging for freedom or find another way out and bring down the whole bloomin’ system?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An atmospheric world with fleshed-out characters; everyone you meet has their own distinct personality and storyline. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiple endings: who you interact with (or don’t) will change the outcome of your story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unique energy system where your actions truly matter as the game tracks your gameplay and punishes/rewards you for your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Life sim where wages, food, rent, and much more are based on the current cost-of-living in the United Kingdom. There's even a tax system calculated to real-world rates!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Diverse range of randomly generated mines and intricately hand-designed levels to ensure you’re always kept on your toes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968180/extras/1e7d3e6eaa087bf4354580153d72c424.poster.avif?t=1788343517\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968180/extras/1e7d3e6eaa087bf4354580153d72c424.webm?t=1788343517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968180/extras/1e7d3e6eaa087bf4354580153d72c424.mp4?t=1788343517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low wage. Exhaustion. Expensive fish and chips. Welcome to the United Kingdom.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DIGGERGUN is an oppressive life sim platformer about workers, minimum pay and the environment. You’re trapped on a blustery island, forced to work at Cornwall Mining Corp where it’s shadier than the game’s monochrome palette. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, you need to earn £3000 from digging precious lithium. To survive, you need to manage your time, energy and money during the rigid day-and-night cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you make ends meet while digging for freedom or find another way out and bring down the whole bloomin’ system?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An atmospheric world with fleshed-out characters; everyone you meet has their own distinct personality and storyline. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiple endings: who you interact with (or don’t) will change the outcome of your story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unique energy system where your actions truly matter as the game tracks your gameplay and punishes/rewards you for your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Life sim where wages, food, rent, and much more are based on the current cost-of-living in the United Kingdom. There's even a tax system calculated to real-world rates!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Diverse range of randomly generated mines and intricately hand-designed levels to ensure you’re always kept on your toes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Blast through Bal Island, collecting lithium in this oppressive platformer about corporate exploitation and pushing back.",
        "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Thai<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Czech<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
